  "instructions": [
    "Heat the vegetable oil in a copper mug over medium heat.",
    "Add the garlic and ginger and cook for 1 minute, until fragrant.",
    "Add the mushrooms and cook for 3 minutes, until they start to soften.",
    "Add the fish sauce, soy sauce, and chili flakes, and cook for 1 minute, until the mushrooms are coated.",
    "Stir in the peanuts and scallions, and cook for 1 minute, until the peanuts are fragrant.",
    "Season with salt and black pepper to taste.",
    "Cook for an additional 2 minutes, until the mushrooms are tender.",
    "Serve hot, garnished with additional scallions and peanuts if desired."
